<title>USA: Goodrich Petroleum holders OK share issue.</title>
<headline>Goodrich Petroleum holders OK share issue.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goodrich Petroleum Corp said Wednesday its shareholders have approved the issuance of 750,000 shares of Series B convertible preferred stock in connection with the acquisition of the reserves and properties of  La/Cal Energy Partners II and certain working interest owners.</p>
<p>Goodrich said it closed the acquisition on Jan. 31 for an adjusted price of $16,481,000, consisting of $1,517,000 cash, $7,500,000 in convertible preferred stock and the payoff of $7,464,000 in indebtedness of La/Cal.</p>
<p>The La/Cal properties, said Goodrich, consisted of 2,370,000 barrels of oil equivalents as of July 1, 1996 estimates, with 72 percent of the reserves being oil.</p>
</text>
